# The kernel of the mainline variant, for now Debian's own: it has Tegra210,
# tegra-drm and nouveau, but no Switch device tree and none of the Switch's
# own drivers. It is the placeholder until the kernel tree is chosen
# (docs/mainline.md, phase 1); that kernel will come as a .deb.
linux-image-arm64

# Firmware the mainline drivers load. Which package ships each file
# (nvidia/tegra210/*, nvidia/gm20b/*, brcm/brcmfmac4356*) is to be confirmed
# against the built rootfs (nxd inspect).
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-brcm80211
